WEBVTT

00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:06.640
At last, the first match of 
the final fight of C Block!

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:08.710
It's <i>oh</i> so thrilling, isn't it?

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:13.060
Kamui Katsuragi of Team 
Quadrifoglio, Q4, versus

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:18.540
Hiromi Miyoji of Team Foo 
Fighter Brilliant Stars, FFBS!

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:23.020
Let the match begin!

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.140
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:05.090
He's playing a Royal Paladin 
deck, just like Brother used to.

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:10.380
But no matter who I'm up against, 
I can't afford to lose this fight!

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:13.410
The Great Kamui rides Blaupanzer!

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:21.850
And with Blaupanzer's skill, if 
there's a Blaujunger in the Soul...

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.800
...Blaupanzer gains +2000 power!

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.400
And with Blaujunger's skill,

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:33.540
if Blaupanzer is ridden, Blaukluger 
can be added to my hand.

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:39.950
Junger, Panzer, Kluger... The Blau series...

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:42.340
They're evolving-type units, aren't they?

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:43.970
Yet...

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:47.310
What's so funny?!

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.610
Well...

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:54.790
...the units I have can evolve 
much more beautifully!

00:02:55.190 --> 00:03:00.200
Another Foo Fighter

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:05.510
Drangal, time to activate your skill.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:09.690
I look at the top five cards of my deck and 
if Knight of Quests, Galahad is there,

00:03:10.610 --> 00:03:13.050
I can do a beautiful superior ride.

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:20.060
What do you think? Beautiful, isn't it?

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:27.510
L! O! V! E! We love B.S.!

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.590
What the heck is that?!

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:35.030
The national tournament is a sacred 
place for serious showdowns!

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:38.790
What do you think of their frivolous 
whooping and hollering, Morikawa?!

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.340
Did you say something?

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.340
Kourin

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:44.230
Oh, that's right...

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:47.690
I call Margal and Marron!

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:51.210
Marron, attack Blaupanzer.

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:58.540
Margal boosts, and then...

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:02.860
...Knight of Quests, Galahad attacks!

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:12.220
Hey, what's wrong?

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:15.650
I felt a trifle faint...

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:18.740
The dance of my sword is too beautiful...

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.940
You're so dreamy, Hiromi!

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:27.900
Oh, shut up, willya?!

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:31.960
S-Sorry...

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:32.940
It's okay, it's okay...

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:39.660
Kamui the Great rides Blaukluger!

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:50.070
When Blaupanzer is in the Soul, 
Blaukluger receives +1000 power!

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:52.690
Next!

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:57.140
I call Eisenkugel, Dancing 
Wolf and King of Sword!

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:02.690
I attack Knight of Quests, 
Galahad with Eisenkugel!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:07.410
With Eisen's skill, when it 
attacks, it gets +2000 power!

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.200
Damage trigger check.

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:18.960
Pixie, give Knight of Quests +5000 power

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.580
and help Marron stand up.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:23.930
I attack Marron with King of Sword!

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:25.340
Elaine, protect him!

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:33.470
With a boost from Dancing Wolf, I attack 
Knight of Quests with Blaukluger!

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:35.440
Drive check!

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:41.420
I draw.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:47.020
Knight of Quests, show 
me a beautiful evolution.

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:49.400
This is unfortunate...

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:53.410
You can't superior ride. 
Not too beautiful, is that?

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:58.580
In that case, I ride Knight of 
Tribulation, Galahad from my hand!

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:17.970
Marron moves, and I call Barron!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:25.650
With a boost from Margal, Knight 
of Tribulation, Galahad attacks Kluger!

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:29.430
Drive trigger!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:36.910
With a boost from Marron, Barron attacks!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.940
I guard with Cannon Ball!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.660
That's the close of my turn.

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:49.830
Yes! It's Kamui the Great's turn! 
Please give it all you've got!

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:50.960
GA, yo!

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:56.880
Here I go!

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:59.440
The Great Kamui does an awesome ride!

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:09.440
The absolutely invincible, armored...

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:12.260
...Stern Blaukluger!

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:17.180
Blaukluger is in the Soul, 
so Stern gets +1000 power.

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:20.110
Eisenkugel, attack Knight of Tribulation!

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:22.010
+2000 power!

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:30.330
With a boost from Dancing Wolf, 
Stern Blaukluger attacks!

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:33.680
Iseult, protect me!

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:41.600
Twin drive...

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:43.270
First check!

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.400
Second check!

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.970
I got a stand trigger!

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.990
Eisenkugel stands!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.480
And I give him the +5000 power!

00:07:56.650 --> 00:08:00.260
The number of your attacks 
increases with a stand trigger?

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:02.590
That's hardly beautiful, you know.

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:06.660
Shut up! What do you know of 
somebody else's athletic sense?!

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.530
"Athletic sense"?!

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:11.370
Kamui the Great, it's "aesthetic sense"!

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:14.420
A-E-S-T-H-E-T-I-C!

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:18.360
I attack with King of Sword!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:23.780
Eisenkugel attacks once more!

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:28.910
Damage check...

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:34.230
Even if you do increase your number of 
attacks, it's a wasted effort against me.

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:39.980
Elaine, give +5000 power 
to Knight of Tribulation.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.480
And let's heal 1 point of damage.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.970
Dang! My turn's over!

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:46.970
I stand and draw.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:51.230
I believe the time is right...

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:53.590
I activate the skill of 
Knight of Tribulation.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.390
Show me a beautiful evolution.

00:08:56.520 --> 00:09:00.440
No matter how many you send forth, 
you won't get ahead of me!

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:03.180
I superior ride Knight of God-speed, Galahad!

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:21.570
From now on, I'll demonstrate 
a truly beautiful way to fight.

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:24.530
I call Pegasus Knight.

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:30.910
If Margal moves to the Soul, one Royal 
Paladin unit receives +3000 power.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:37.840
And during the main phase, if my cards 
move to the Soul, just like with Margal,

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:40.900
Pegasus's skill activates.

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:44.440
If my Vanguard is a Royal Paladin, 
it receives +3000 power.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:45.420
Also...

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:48.950
...Barron has that same skill!

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:51.290
All right...

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.790
My cute Tamer,

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:58.160
come to the rear-guard and 
lend your power to a friend!

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:04.480
Akane, with your skill, I can 
superior call a new Margal!

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:08.600
Margal, again give your power to Pegasus.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:10.750
And then, I activate Pegasus's skill again...

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:14.120
...as well as Barron's skill!

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.800
On top of that, Knight of 
God-speed's beautiful skill!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.500
Counterblast!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:23.540
If there are six or more cards in the 
Soul, the Knight receives +3000 power

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.860
and an extra critical!

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:31.230
Pegasus Knight has 15000. Barron has 14000.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:33.750
Knight of God-speed has 17000...

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:38.330
Hiromi is as impressive as ever, isn't he?

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:41.020
He powers up by linking his allies...

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:43.550
That's the true value of 
the Royal Paladin deck.

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:45.680
It's a very "Hiromi" way to do it.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:48.500
He's been waiting to form this arrangement.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:54.710
Before the time is right, I flutter like a 
butterfly. Once it is, I sting like a bee.

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:58.540
That's my Vanguard aesthetic.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.090
Aichi...

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:20.470
Emi...

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:22.520
What about the fights...?

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:24.210
W-Wait!

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:29.500
You've got to lie down! What if you 
watch the fights and get sick again?!

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:39.380
Good luck, Hiromi!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:41.920
Wipe the floor with that little brat!

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:46.790
W-What's wrong, Morikawa?

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:48.630
J-Just for today,

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:53.010
I feel like cheering on that punk 
Kamui from the bottom of my heart!

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:56.760
You can't cheer him on normally, can you?

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:00.200
Barron! I attack with a boost from Barron!

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:04.980
Damage check!

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:12.840
I want you to receive

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:14.300
a beautiful attack from God-speed!

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:21.050
I guard with Battleraizer!

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:24.010
And I intercept with King of Sword!

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:30.500
Twin drive!

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:37.890
No matter how many times I see the 
critical icon, it's always beautiful.

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:39.930
I add +5000 to the power of Akane...

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:42.090
...and give her the extra critical as well!

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:46.430
Akane! With a boost from Pegasus, attack!

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:49.430
28000 power?!

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:51.680
But I'll hold out against it!

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:53.970
Kluger, Panzer!

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:57.790
Fighting Battleship Prometheus!

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:13.520
Not bad. You've managed to only
 take one damage during that turn.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.040
Of course!

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:18.470
I already knew that's how the 
Royal Paladin deck is played.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:21.300
I was taught that...

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:30.680
...by him. And I can't let him 
see me in an embarrassing fight!

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:35.630
It's the Great Kamui's turn!

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:38.640
Please wipe out his Vanguard 
in one fell swoop!

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:40.070
WO, yo!

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:41.790
I don't know about that...

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:45.930
I call Asura Kaiser!

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:53.120
All right...

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:57.970
Stern Blaukluger's attack 
will definitely get through!

00:13:57.970 --> 00:14:00.820
Eisenkugel, attack Barron!

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:07.510
Asura Kaiser, attack Akane!

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:14.550
A rear-guard attack?

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:17.290
Look carefully at the ones 
he retired from the field.

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:23.160
Intercept blocking!

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:27.500
Otherwise, they would get in the way 
of Stern's attack going through.

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:30.790
If Stern's attack works here, 
this will really get interesting.

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:35.170
With a boost from Dancing 
Wolf, Stern Blaukluger

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:38.170
attacks Knight of God-speed, Galahad!

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:41.600
What's funny?!

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:46.600
Even if you remove my interceptors, 
I still have cards in my hand.

00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:50.280
I guard with Alabaster Owl!

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:55.790
The one who's going to 
triumph is the beautiful me!

00:14:57.690 --> 00:15:00.830
No, it's not over yet! I can't lose!

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.450
For Brother's sake!

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:04.620
Twin drive check!

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:09.420
Heal trigger!

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:13.730
I add +5000 to the power of Stern Blaukluger!

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:16.420
And I heal 1 point of damage!

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.490
5 damage...

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.390
No, more importantly...

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:32.300
That's right. As soon as his attack hits,

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:35.630
Stern's skill can be activated!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:41.040
Counterblast! And I discard 
two cards from my hand.

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:46.880
With this, Stern Blaukluger and the 
rear-guard behind him can stand!

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:49.720
And now for my finishing move!

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:54.850
Cyclone Stand Thunderbolt!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:04.720
And Dancing Wolf's skill activates, too!

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:10.070
During the battle phase, when this 
unit stands, it gets +3000 power!

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:20.400
I'm not going to lose my head 
just because it's come to this.

00:16:20.400 --> 00:16:22.280
Beautiful no guard!

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:30.750
With a boost from Dancing Wolf, 
Stern Blaukluger attacks once more!

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:36.290
Cyclone Stand Thunderbolt, eh?

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:40.860
It's frustrating, but also 
a little beautiful...

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:54.610
The winner is Kamui Katsuragi!

00:16:57.420 --> 00:17:00.450
Yes! Kamui the Great did it!

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.170
KG, yo!

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.030
He managed to win the first match.

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:06.500
Hiromi!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.660
You look beautiful even when you lose!

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.050
What are they saying?

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:14.520
In that case, I hope he loses 
for the rest of his life!

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:20.420
Hmph! Glare all you want, 
I don't feel a thing!

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.760
What is this image?

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:31.400
Stop it!!

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:35.100
That was kind of close,

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:36.060
but...

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:40.550
...even though he used a Royal Paladin 
deck, he didn't hold a candle to Brother.

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:43.660
Good for you.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.030
You people won the first match.

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:49.570
But your victory as a team has vanished.

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:50.280
What?!

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:55.870
This defeat has really fired 
up my beautiful teammates.

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:10.480
The winner, Asaka Narumi!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:18.500
In F Block, Team AL4 is on their way to 
the finals with an undefeated record!

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:22.900
Mr. Miya, it looks like C Block 
is... <i>oh</i>, also drawing to a close!

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.450
I can see how this match will turn out.

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:37.190
Both Wiseman and Goddess of 
the Half Moon can intercept...

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:39.180
I can hold on!

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.090
Show her how you break through a barrier!

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:46.610
I ride...

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:52.800
Oh, no! That's...

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.280
Blockade, activate your skill!

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:08.560
This is my finishing blow, Vanishing Field!

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:12.780
As long as Blockade is around, 
your units can't intercept!

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:14.970
Call!

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:18.690
Tejas! With a boost from 
Bahr, attack Amaterasu!

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:27.340
And then this Blockade

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:30.830
attacks with a boost from 
Heat Nail Salamander!

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.510
I guard with Lozenge Magus!

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:35.430
Twin drive check!

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:38.680
First card, second card...

00:19:40.380 --> 00:19:43.070
As you can see, I got a draw trigger.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.020
I draw one card, and then...

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:48.020
...add +5000 to the power of Blockade!

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:03.160
The winner is Harumi Minami from FFBS!

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:13.370
It's just like he said...

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:16.480
Shoot! They didn't get it, huh?

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:18.030
LM, yo...

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.710
Lost the match...

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:23.610
The third match is left...

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.690
Team Q4 versus FFBS!

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:30.190
Which of them is the 
strongest team in C Block?

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:32.150
Sorry...

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:33.880
It was a close one.

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:38.020
But he... she?... lived 
up to being a Foo Fighter.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:39.960
Where's the Sleeping Prince?

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:42.390
Is he really sleeping?

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:46.880
Or is he so terrified of my ability 
that he's curled up into a ball?

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:49.870
That creep...

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:52.280
But we can't have Aichi come out here...

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:57.770
FFBS arrives first.

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.670
Aichi, I bought you a drink!

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:01.770
Huh?

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:04.370
Aichi?

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:07.970
...Guess it can't be helped.

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:10.570
And his opponent from Q4 is also here!

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.680
B-Brother!

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:15.530
Why?!

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:18.810
I rested up a bit.

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:20.820
I'm all right now.

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:24.850
But I guess I'm a little 
disappointed in you two.

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:29.350
Without me out here, Q4 can't win.

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:34.980
Brother...?

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:39.980
I was convinced you'd run away.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:44.290
Oh, please. There's no need for me 
to be afraid of someone like you.

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:46.340
Why, you...

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:54.240
Has the fight already started?

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:58.460
Could a guy like this really have 
mastered the Shadow Paladin deck?

00:21:58.850 --> 00:21:59.950
I'm going to win.

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:03.170
And then I'll become a member of AL4!

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:07.620
I'm... stronger...

00:22:08.460 --> 00:22:09.600
...than anyone!

00:23:51.810 --> 00:23:54.880
I'm sorry... After you won the first match...

00:23:54.880 --> 00:23:55.960
Misaki...

00:23:55.960 --> 00:23:59.680
You all did your best, so there's no 
need to kick yourselves over the result.

00:23:59.680 --> 00:24:00.580
But...

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:02.440
You mean Aichi?

00:24:02.440 --> 00:24:04.230
What's your name again... "Bidou"?

00:24:04.230 --> 00:24:06.100
I'm not going to lose.

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:08.330
Next time: Lonely Fight.

00:24:09.050 --> 00:24:10.520
It's too bad.

00:24:10.520 --> 00:24:14.180
I can't picture you standing in my path.

00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:16.050
I'm sure Brother will win...

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:16.780
...but...
